        "TileImage": "$($repository 0a4f2b5e-b070-46df-b1ea-c1e2f7ff81e7).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is Dean Paris, an Australian businessman who our client believes is the murderer of someone in their family. In  1995, Elisa Day was found dead laying in a flower bed on a river bank, earning her the nickname &quot;The Wild Rose.&quot; Dean Paris had been known to be romancing her for weeks at that point, and was reportedly seen with Day that morning. But after a lengthy investigation, Paris was cleared. The family never bought it, and now, they want an eye for an eye.\r-Diana",
